{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31588","headline":"江楼闲望怀关中亲故 · 李羣玉","name":"江楼闲望怀关中亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摇落江天欲尽秋，远鸿高送一行愁。\n音书寂绝秦云外，身世蹉跎楚水头。\n年貌暗随黄叶去，时情深付碧波流。\n风凄日冷江湖晚，驻目寒空独倚楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}